== Impeccable derivation (retained from this repository's ui-skills era) ==

This project includes modified portions of Impeccable:
https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable

Impeccable copyright 2025 Paul Bakaus.

The material has been reorganized into standalone skills, rewritten for use
outside the Impeccable framework, and stripped of Impeccable-specific hooks,
runtime services, persistence, command routing, and mandatory workflow steps.
See DERIVATION.md. Those texts now live as authored references inside the
design, build, and review skills.
